  "description_blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Overview"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "These models offer both storage and organization for desiccant packs, and are equipped with circular hygrometers for precise monitoring of environmental temperature and humidity. By maintaining optimal environmental conditions, these models effectively protect moisture-sensitive components and materials, ensuring their performance and longevity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "Creator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Dry Pod Storage with Funnel for AMS"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This model is an upgraded version of the AMS desiccant storage solution that allows the use of loose (silica gel) desiccant. It also includes an extra drying chamber that allows the AMS to store more desiccant, meaning longer refresh intervals. It's also got a funnel to help load the silica gel and minimize spillage."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "Ultimate Filament Spool Enclosure for AMS Lite"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This model offers both storage and organization for desiccant packs, and is equipped with circular hygrometers for precise monitoring of environmental temperature and humidity. By maintaining optimal environmental conditions, this model effectively protect moisture-sensitive components and materials, ensuring their performance and longevity."
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "text": "SPILLPROOF AMS Desiccant Box"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "text": "This round hygrometer, when combined with a 3D-printed desiccant box, efficiently monitors the storage environment of your 3D printing materials."
    }
  ],
  "description_html": "<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_tpc-ic\" style=\"text-align: left; padding: 40px 20px 0;\">\n<h1 class=\"pct_t\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Overview</h1>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">These models offer both storage and organization for desiccant packs, and are equipped with circular hygrometers for precise monitoring of environmental temperature and humidity. By maintaining optimal environmental conditions, these models effectively protect moisture-sensitive components and materials, ensuring their performance and longevity.<span></span><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\"></span></em></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\"></span></em></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">Creator Program</span><span style=\"color: #e60034; text-decoration: underline;\">:</span></em></strong></span><strong><em> </em></strong>The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\"></h3>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\"><!-- 第一æ�?-->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 --><!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<h2 class=\"pct_t\">Product Application</h2>\n<!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Dry Pod Storage with Funnel for AMS</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">This model is an upgraded version of the AMS desiccant storage solution that allows the use of loose (silica gel) desiccant. It also includes an extra drying chamber that allows the AMS to store more desiccant, meaning longer refresh intervals. It's also got a funnel to help load the silica gel and minimize spillage.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"> </p>\nThe model is compatible with both<span style=\"color: #80ff00;\"> <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/rectangular-embedded-electronic-digital-thermometer-hygrometer?_pos=1&amp;_sid=ade1e0d35&amp;_ss=r\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">rectangular thermohygrometers</a></span></span> and <span style=\"color: #00ae42;\"><a href=\"https://us.store.bambulab.com/products/circular-embedded-electronic-digital-thermometer-hygrometer-1pcs-xf001?_pos=1&amp;_sid=b48c72093&amp;_ss=r\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color: #00ae42;\" target=\"_blank\">circular thermohygrometers</a></span>, so you can choose to print parts based on the shape of your thermohygrometer.</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/no3.png?v=1739762028\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/no3.png?v=1739762028\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第二条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">Ultimate Filament Spool Enclosure for AMS Lite</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">This model offers both storage and organization for desiccant packs, and is equipped with circular hygrometers for precise monitoring of environmental temperature and humidity. By maintaining optimal environmental conditions, this model effectively protect moisture-sensitive components and materials, ensuring their performance and longevity.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/2_726534c7-2058-4a8d-badb-a696c1605819.png?v=1739764231\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/2_726534c7-2058-4a8d-badb-a696c1605819.png?v=1739764231\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 第三条 -->\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\"><!-- 左侧文案部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_st-p\">\n<h3 class=\"pct_st\">SPILLPROOF AMS Desiccant Box</h3>\n<p class=\"pct_p\">This round hygrometer, when combined with a 3D-printed desiccant box, efficiently monitors the storage environment of your 3D printing materials.</p>\n<p class=\"pct_p\"> </p>\nWith the precisely designed AMS desiccant box, you can easily install the hygrometer in the designated position without any tilt, keeping humidity data clearly visible.\n<p class=\"pct_p\"> </p>\nThe model securely holds the hygrometer and allows for additional desiccant, maximizing material preservation while ensuring the hygrometer remains functional and accessible.</div>\n<!-- 右侧图片部分 -->\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"><!-- 手机端图片 --> <img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_mi product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/3_b591219b-2428-49ea-8975-4ffb945f0a4e.png?v=1739764218\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/> <!-- PC端图片 --> <img alt=\"\" class=\"pct_i product-desc-lazy-media product-desc-lazy-media--image bg-bbl-white animate-pulse max-h-[400px]\" data-lazy=\"false\" data-src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0584/7236/6216/files/3_b591219b-2428-49ea-8975-4ffb945f0a4e.png?v=1739764218\" src=\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMjQiIGhlaWdodD0iMjQiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAyNCAyNCIgZmlsbD0ibm9uZSIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj4KPHJlY3Qgd2lkdGg9IjI0IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjI0IiBmaWxsPSIjRkZGRkZGIi8+Cjwvc3ZnPgo=\"/></div>\n</div>\n<!-- 如需添加在此处添加 --></div>\n</div>\n<p> </p>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpcic\">\n<div class=\"pct_stpc-ic\">\n<div class=\"pct_ic\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-stpc\"><!-- 第一条 -->\n<div class=\"pct pct_mc\">\n<div class=\"pct_t-tb\">\n<div class=