  "description_text": "These models offer both storage and organization for desiccant packs, and are equipped with circular hygrometers for precise monitoring of environmental temperature and humidity. By maintaining optimal environmental conditions, these models effectively protect moisture-sensitive components and materials, ensuring their performance and longevity.\n\nCreator Program: The Creator Program is a collaborative program between Bambu Lab and creators. Creators unleash their creativity to design 3D printing models, while Bambu Lab provides compatible hardware kits for those designs.\n\nThis model is an upgraded version of the AMS desiccant storage solution that allows the use of loose (silica gel) desiccant. It also includes an extra drying chamber that allows the AMS to store more desiccant, meaning longer refresh intervals. It's also got a funnel to help load the silica gel and minimize spillage.\n\nThis model offers both storage and organization for desiccant packs, and is equipped with circular hygrometers for precise monitoring of environmental temperature and humidity. By maintaining optimal environmental conditions, this model effectively protect moisture-sensitive components and materials, ensuring their performance and longevity.\n\nThis round hygrometer, when combined with a 3D-printed desiccant box, efficiently monitors the storage environment of your 3D printing materials.",
